passages.text:
It will take more than a damn shipwreck to bring me down. Those overgrown, vomit-reeking, demon felbags have another thing coming if they think that's all it's gonna take to stop me. 

<Keeshan coughs up seawater, wiping his mouth dry with his sleeve.>

Ughh... I may need a little breather though. Here, take this flare gun and use it to call down artillery strikes on the beach. Rain hell on those worthless, half-goat bastards and I'll rendezvous with you back at the base when the mission is complete! 
